{"id":"u53","kelas":"kerja","no":6,"judul":"Penjadwalan dan Janji Temu","title":"Scheduling and Appointments","emoji":"📅","ringkas":"Membuat, mengubah, membatalkan janji, dan tenggat waktu","ready":true,"goals":["membuat, mengubah, dan membatalkan **janji temu** dengan sopan","menanyakan dan menyatakan ketersediaan: [[Are you free on ...?]], [[I'm available at ...]]","memakai preposisi waktu: [[at]], [[on]], [[in]], [[by]], [[until]], [[before]], [[after]]","menyebut **tenggat** dan **jadwal** dengan jelas","memakai [[will]], [[be going to]], dan present continuous untuk rencana","memahami perbedaan **zona waktu** dan format jam 12/24"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Hampir semua pekerjaan melibatkan **jadwal**: rapat, janji dengan klien, dan tenggat. Salah membaca waktu bisa berarti rapat terlewat. Di unit ini kamu belajar mengatur, mengubah, dan membatalkan janji dengan jelas dan sopan."},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Membuat janji","table":[["Fungsi","Ungkapan","Contoh"],["Mengusulkan","[[Would you be free on ...?]] / [[How about ...?]]","[[How about Tuesday at 10?]]"],["Menanyakan ketersediaan","[[Are you available on ...?]]","[[Are you available on Thursday afternoon?]]"],["Menyetujui","[[That works for me.]] / [[Tuesday suits me.]]","[[That works for me. See you then.]]"],["Menolak waktu","[[I'm afraid I'm not available then.]]","[[I'm afraid I have another meeting.]]"],["Mengusulkan lain","[[Would ... be possible instead?]]","[[Would Wednesday be possible instead?]]"],["Mengonfirmasi","[[Let's make it Tuesday at 10.]] / [[I'll put it in my calendar.]]","[[Let's make it Tuesday at 10.]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"2. Mengubah dan membatalkan","table":[["Fungsi","Ungkapan"],["Menunda","[[I'd like to postpone our meeting.]] / [[Could we postpone it to ...?]]"],["Menjadwal ulang","[[Could we reschedule for ...?]] / [[Can we move it to ...?]]"],["Memajukan","[[Could we bring the meeting forward to ...?]]"],["Membatalkan","[[I'm sorry, but I have to cancel our appointment.]]"],["Meminta maaf","[[I apologise for the short notice.]] / [[Sorry for any inconvenience.]]"],["Berterima kasih","[[Thank you for your understanding.]]"]]},{"t":"warn","title":"Postpone vs bring forward","text":"[[postpone]] / [[put off]] = mundurkan ke waktu lebih lambat. [[bring forward]] = majukan ke waktu lebih awal. [[reschedule]] = ubah jadwal ke waktu lain (bisa lebih awal atau lambat)."},{"t":"grammar","title":"3. Preposisi waktu","table":[["Preposisi","Dipakai untuk","Contoh"],["**at**","jam, saat tertentu","[[at 9 a.m.]] / [[at noon]] / [[at the end of the day]]"],["**on**","hari dan tanggal","[[on Monday]] / [[on 5 May]]"],["**in**","bulan, tahun, bagian hari","[[in June]] / [[in 2026]] / [[in the morning]]"],["**by**","paling lambat pada","[[by Friday]] = paling lambat hari Jumat"],["**until / till**","terus sampai","[[until Friday]] = sampai hari Jumat"],["**before / after**","sebelum / sesudah","[[before lunch]] / [[after the meeting]]"],["**for**","lama waktu","[[for two hours]]"],["**from ... to**","rentang","[[from 9 to 11]]"]]},{"t":"tip","title":"By vs until","text":"[[Submit it **by** Friday.]] = kirim paling lambat Jumat (boleh sebelum itu). [[The shop is open **until** 9.]] = buka terus hingga pukul 9. By untuk **tenggat**, until untuk **durasi berlanjut**."},{"t":"vocab","title":"4. Kosakata penting","items":[{"en":"appointment","id":"janji temu","ex":"I have an appointment at 10."},{"en":"schedule","id":"jadwal / menjadwalkan","ex":"Let's schedule a call."},{"en":"calendar","id":"kalender","ex":"I'll check my calendar."},{"en":"available / free","id":"tersedia / senggang","ex":"Are you free tomorrow?"},{"en":"postpone","id":"menunda","ex":"We postponed the meeting."},{"en":"reschedule","id":"menjadwal ulang","ex":"Can we reschedule?"},{"en":"cancel","id":"membatalkan","ex":"I need to cancel."},{"en":"confirm","id":"mengonfirmasi","ex":"Please confirm the time."},{"en":"clash","id":"bentrok","ex":"Two meetings clash."},{"en":"short notice","id":"pemberitahuan mendadak","ex":"I'm sorry for the short notice."},{"en":"time zone","id":"zona waktu","ex":"What's the time zone?"},{"en":"deadline","id":"tenggat","ex":"The deadline is Friday."},{"en":"due date","id":"tanggal jatuh tempo","ex":"The due date is 30 June."},{"en":"slot","id":"slot waktu","ex":"Is there a slot on Monday?"},{"en":"agenda","id":"agenda","ex":"Please check the agenda."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"5. Menyebut rencana dan jam","table":[["Pola","Contoh"],["Rencana pasti (present continuous)","[[I'm meeting a client on Monday at 10.]]"],["Rencana (be going to)","[[We're going to hold the meeting in Room 3.]]"],["Keputusan spontan (will)","[[I'll send you the invitation.]]"],["Jam 12 dan 24","[[3 p.m. = 15:00]], [[9 a.m. = 09:00]]"],["Cara membaca","[[10:30 = half past ten]], [[10:45 = a quarter to eleven]], [[10:15 = a quarter past ten]]"],["Zona waktu","[[It's 9 a.m. in Jakarta, so it's 11 a.m. in Tokyo.]]"]]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog 1: Membuat janji","lines":[{"who":"Dina","en":"Hello, Mr. Adi. I'd like to schedule a meeting about the new project. Are you available on Tuesday?","id":"Halo, Pak Adi. Saya ingin menjadwalkan rapat tentang proyek baru. Apakah Bapak tersedia hari Selasa?"},{"who":"Mr. Adi","en":"Let me check my calendar. I'm afraid I have another meeting in the morning. How about Tuesday at two?","id":"Biar saya cek kalender. Sayangnya saya ada rapat lain pagi hari. Bagaimana kalau Selasa pukul dua?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"That works for me. How long do you need?","id":"Itu cocok untuk saya. Berapa lama Bapak butuh waktu?"},{"who":"Mr. Adi","en":"About an hour, until three. I'll send an invitation.","id":"Sekitar satu jam, sampai pukul tiga. Saya akan kirim undangan."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog 2: Menjadwal ulang","lines":[{"who":"Tom","en":"Ms. Sari, I'm sorry for the short notice, but I have to reschedule tomorrow's meeting.","id":"Bu Sari, maaf atas pemberitahuan mendadak, tetapi saya harus menjadwal ulang rapat besok."},{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"That's okay. What time are you available instead?","id":"Tidak apa-apa. Pukul berapa kamu tersedia sebagai gantinya?"},{"who":"Tom","en":"Could we move it to Thursday morning, before lunch?","id":"Bisakah dipindah ke Kamis pagi, sebelum makan siang?"},{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"Thursday at ten works for me. Please send a new invitation.","id":"Kamis pukul sepuluh cocok untuk saya. Tolong kirim undangan baru."},{"who":"Tom","en":"Of course. Thank you for your understanding.","id":"Tentu. Terima kasih atas pengertian Ibu."}]},{"t":"summary","items":["Mengusulkan: [[How about ...?]] / [[Would you be free on ...?]]; menyetujui: [[That works for me.]]","Mengubah: [[postpone]] (mundur), [[bring forward]] (maju), [[reschedule]], [[cancel]].","Preposisi: [[at]] jam, [[on]] hari, [[in]] bulan, [[by]] tenggat, [[until]] sampai.","Minta maaf atas pemberitahuan mendadak: [[I apologise for the short notice.]]"]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kosakata dengan artinya:","pairs":[["appointment","janji temu"],["postpone","menunda"],["reschedule","menjadwal ulang"],["cancel","membatalkan"],["clash","bentrok"]],"exp":"Kosakata penjadwalan.","k":"3b85693e"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan preposisi dengan penggunaannya:","pairs":[["at","jam"],["on","hari"],["in","bulan"],["by","tenggat"]],"exp":"Preposisi waktu.","k":"757fd365"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan jam dengan cara membacanya:","pairs":[["10:30","half past ten"],["10:45","a quarter to eleven"],["10:15","a quarter past ten"],["10:00","ten o'clock"]],"exp":"Membaca jam.","k":"8187d237"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Cara sopan mengusulkan waktu adalah...","options":["How about Tuesday at ten?","Tuesday. Now.","You come Tuesday.","Tuesday is fine for me only."],"answer":0,"exp":"How about ...?","k":"5108b879"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Cara menyetujui usulan jadwal adalah...","options":["That works for me.","That's a pity.","I don't know you.","Goodbye."],"answer":0,"exp":"works for me.","k":"fd9bdb06"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Cara menolak waktu dengan sopan adalah...","options":["I'm afraid I'm not available then.","No.","Never.","That's silly."],"answer":0,"exp":"Sopan.","k":"f091480b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Untuk memundurkan jadwal kita memakai...","options":["postpone","bring forward","advance","hurry"],"answer":0,"exp":"postpone.","k":"5139d72a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Untuk memajukan jadwal kita memakai...","options":["bring forward","postpone","put off","delay"],"answer":0,"exp":"bring forward.","k":"7d65ad7b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Preposisi yang tepat: \"The meeting is ___ Monday.\"","options":["on","at","in","by"],"answer":0,"exp":"on + hari.","k":"887183a6"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Preposisi yang tepat: \"The meeting starts ___ 9 a.m.\"","options":["at","on","in","until"],"answer":0,"exp":"at + jam.","k":"7de898ca"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Preposisi yang tepat: \"Please submit the report ___ Friday.\" (paling lambat)","options":["by","until","at","in"],"answer":0,"exp":"by = paling lambat.","k":"281c1720"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Preposisi yang tepat: \"I'll be in the office ___ 5 p.m.\" (terus sampai)","options":["until","by","on","at the"],"answer":0,"exp":"until = sampai.","k":"f200e53f"},{"type":"mcq","q":"15:00 sama dengan...","options":["3 p.m.","3 a.m.","5 p.m.","1 p.m."],"answer":0,"exp":"15 - 12 = 3.","k":"b16e7e0a"},{"type":"fill","id":"Bagaimana kalau Selasa pukul sepuluh?","q":"___ about Tuesday at ten?","answers":["how","How"],"hint":"bagaimana","exp":"How about ...?","k":"e6d6d992"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya akan memeriksa kalender saya.","q":"I'll check my ___.","answers":["calendar"],"hint":"kalender","exp":"calendar.","k":"e405d5d4"},{"type":"fill","id":"Maaf atas pemberitahuan mendadak.","q":"I apologise for the short ___.","answers":["notice"],"hint":"pemberitahuan","exp":"short notice.","k":"5e8e9850"},{"type":"fill","id":"Bisakah kita memindahkan rapat ke hari Kamis?","q":"Could we ___ it to Thursday?","answers":["move"],"hint":"memindah","exp":"move.","k":"606b5ffa"},{"type":"fill","id":"Rapat berlangsung dari pukul 9 sampai 11.","q":"The meeting is ___ 9 to 11.","answers":["from"],"hint":"dari","exp":"from ... to ...","k":"7c8eeed7"},{"type":"fill","id":"Rapat berlangsung selama dua jam.","q":"The meeting lasts ___ two hours.","answers":["for"],"hint":"selama","exp":"for + durasi.","k":"add37a7a"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Bisakah kita menjadwal ulang untuk hari Kamis?\"","answer":"Could we reschedule for Thursday?","exp":"reschedule for.","k":"ac7655eb"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Saya harus membatalkan janji kita.\"","answer":"I have to cancel our appointment.","exp":"have to + V1.","k":"a12054ae"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Are you available on Tuesday","options":["Apakah Anda tersedia hari Selasa","Apakah hari ini Selasa","Aku suka hari Selasa","Selasa libur"],"answer":0,"exp":"available.","k":"f7b9d77a"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"I would like to reschedule our meeting","options":["Saya ingin menjadwal ulang rapat kita","Saya membatalkan rapat","Rapat kita selesai","Saya terlambat"],"answer":0,"exp":"reschedule.","k":"e9686a45"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Thank you for your understanding","options":["Terima kasih atas pengertian Anda","Terima kasih kembali","Saya mengerti","Saya tidak mengerti"],"answer":0,"exp":"understanding.","k":"336263ec"},{"type":"fill","id":"Rapat dimulai pukul sembilan pagi.","q":"The meeting starts ___ nine in the morning.","answers":["at"],"hint":"jam","exp":"at + jam.","k":"bd264399"},{"type":"fill","id":"Tenggatnya bulan Juni.","q":"The deadline is ___ June.","answers":["in"],"hint":"bulan","exp":"in + bulan.","k":"4c6cf1d1"},{"type":"fill","id":"Tenggatnya tanggal 5 Mei.","q":"The deadline is ___ 5 May.","answers":["on"],"hint":"tanggal","exp":"on + tanggal.","k":"64442483"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kami buka sampai pukul lima.","q":"We are open ___ 5 p.m.","answers":["until","till"],"hint":"sampai","exp":"until.","k":"d88b174d"},{"type":"fill","id":"Mohon kirim sebelum makan siang.","q":"Please send it ___ lunch.","answers":["before"],"hint":"sebelum","exp":"before.","k":"fd9c79c3"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kita bisa bicara setelah rapat.","q":"We can talk ___ the meeting.","answers":["after"],"hint":"setelah","exp":"after.","k":"441ef9b1"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia menunda rapat sampai minggu depan.","q":"She ___ the meeting until next week. (postpone)","answers":["postponed"],"hint":"V2","exp":"postponed.","k":"fbb21bd9"},{"type":"fill","id":"Mohon kirim undangan baru.","q":"Please send a new ___.","answers":["invitation"],"hint":"undangan","exp":"invitation.","k":"4694c464"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dua rapat itu bentrok.","q":"The two meetings ___.","answers":["clash"],"hint":"bentrok","exp":"clash.","k":"888a81c9"},{"type":"fill","id":"Apakah ada slot hari Senin?","q":"Is there a ___ on Monday?","answers":["slot"],"hint":"slot","exp":"slot.","k":"ee8423f1"},{"type":"fill","id":"Tanggal jatuh tempo adalah 30 Juni.","q":"The ___ date is 30 June.","answers":["due"],"hint":"jatuh tempo","exp":"due date.","k":"4494bc75"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang benar?","options":["I'm free on Wednesday afternoon.","I'm free in Wednesday afternoon.","I'm free at Wednesday afternoon.","I'm free by Wednesday afternoon in."],"answer":0,"exp":"on + hari.","k":"73d92671"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang benar?","options":["See you in the morning.","See you at the morning.","See you on the morning.","See you by morning in."],"answer":0,"exp":"in the morning.","k":"aa5668bc"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang benar?","options":["The report is due by Friday.","The report is due until Friday.","The report is due at Friday.","The report is due in on Friday."],"answer":0,"exp":"by Friday.","k":"ce3ba184"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang menunjukkan tenggat?","options":["Submit it by 5 p.m.","Wait until 5 p.m.","Work for five hours.","Stay at five."],"answer":0,"exp":"by = paling lambat.","k":"272c637e"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang menunjukkan durasi berlanjut?","options":["The office is open until 6 p.m.","Submit it by 6 p.m.","Arrive at 6 p.m.","Leave on 6 p.m."],"answer":0,"exp":"until.","k":"b35719e0"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang sopan saat meminta mundur jadwal?","options":["Would it be possible to postpone it to next week?","I won't come.","Change it.","No meeting."],"answer":0,"exp":"Sopan.","k":"3095a093"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang sopan saat membatalkan?","options":["I'm sorry, but I have to cancel our appointment.","Cancelled.","I don't want it.","Forget it."],"answer":0,"exp":"Sopan.","k":"7ee4c132"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang benar?","options":["Shall we meet at half past two?","Shall we meet in half past two?","Shall we meet on half past two?","Shall we meet by half past two at?"],"answer":0,"exp":"at half past two.","k":"a65b9f8f"},{"type":"mcq","q":"14:45 dibaca...","options":["a quarter to three","a quarter past two","half past three","two o'clock"],"answer":0,"exp":"14:45 = 2:45 p.m.","k":"35c34586"},{"type":"mcq","q":"08:15 dibaca...","options":["a quarter past eight","a quarter to eight","half past eight","eight fifty"],"answer":0,"exp":"8:15.","k":"91a59d75"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata \"agenda\" artinya...","options":["daftar acara rapat","kantor","kursi","buku"],"answer":0,"exp":"agenda.","k":"a7f6ba78"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata \"availability\" artinya...","options":["ketersediaan","kesalahan","kecepatan","keberanian"],"answer":0,"exp":"availability.","k":"aa39cdec"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang rencana yang sudah diatur?","options":["We're having a call at 3 p.m. today.","We have a call.","We had a call.","We will have had a call."],"answer":0,"exp":"present continuous.","k":"5b5d41ee"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Bagaimana kalau Rabu pukul sepuluh?\"","answer":"How about Wednesday at ten?","exp":"How about ...?","k":"5830ab28"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan lawan kata:","pairs":[["postpone","bring forward"],["early","late"],["accept","decline"],["available","busy"]],"exp":"Lawan kata.","k":"6975e34e"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Could we move it to Thursday morning","options":["Bisakah kita memindahkannya ke Kamis pagi","Kamis pagi libur","Saya pindah kantor","Saya tiba Kamis"],"answer":0,"exp":"move it.","k":"8c86c384"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"I will put it in my calendar","options":["Saya akan memasukkannya ke kalender saya","Saya membeli kalender","Kalender saya hilang","Saya tidak punya kalender"],"answer":0,"exp":"calendar.","k":"5f0ac391"},{"type":"fill","id":"Bisakah kita menjadwalkan rapat hari Selasa?","q":"Can we ___ a meeting on Tuesday?","answers":["schedule","arrange","set up"],"hint":"menjadwalkan","exp":"schedule.","k":"28c10d59"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya punya janji temu pukul tiga.","q":"I have an ___ at three o'clock.","answers":["appointment"],"hint":"janji temu","exp":"appointment.","k":"67b5be53"},{"type":"fill","id":"Bisakah kita memajukan rapat?","q":"Can we ___ the meeting forward?","answers":["move","bring"],"hint":"memajukan","exp":"move.","k":"d1100873"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kita perlu mengubah jadwal.","q":"We need to ___ the schedule.","answers":["reschedule","change"],"hint":"menjadwal ulang","exp":"reschedule.","k":"60dcf063"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya tidak bisa hadir, ada bentrokan jadwal.","q":"I can't make it; I have a ___.","answers":["conflict","clash"],"hint":"bentrok","exp":"conflict.","k":"0f5553e9"},{"type":"fill","id":"Apakah Jumat pagi cocok untuk Anda?","q":"Does Friday morning ___ for you?","answers":["work","suit"],"hint":"cocok","exp":"work.","k":"718c1d41"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya senggang setelah jam makan siang.","q":"I'm ___ after lunch.","answers":["free","available"],"hint":"senggang","exp":"free.","k":"1cca165c"},{"type":"fill","id":"Mari kita bertemu pukul 10.30.","q":"Let's ___ at 10.30.","answers":["meet"],"hint":"bertemu","exp":"meet.","k":"89fdba99"},{"type